stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> source_submitted
  source_submitted --> parsed : grapheme parse
  parsed --> lowered : hir/mir passes
  lowered --> verified : policy and invariant checks
  verified --> artifact_published : artifact emit

  artifact_published --> enqueued : stasis enqueue
  enqueued --> leased : worker lease
  leased --> running : runtime start
  running --> succeeded : execution success
  running --> failed : execution error
  failed --> enqueued : retry with backoff
  failed --> dead_letter : max attempts exceeded
  dead_letter --> enqueued : operator replay
  succeeded --> [*]
